__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.csv
*.png

# Local viewer state: the recent-files list, which holds absolute paths from
# whichever machine ran it. Hidden because the app maintains it and there is
# nothing in it to hand-edit; it is recreated when absent.
#
# Its companion `ucatsb_gui_config.yaml` is deliberately NOT ignored: that
# file holds the ICARTT header metadata, which describes the campaign rather
# than one machine, so a fresh clone should arrive with it already filled in.
# Splitting the two is what makes tracking it practical -- the recent list is
# rewritten on every dataset load, and while they shared a file that file was
# permanently modified in the working tree.
.ucatsb_gui_state.yaml

# Written beside each loaded CSV by the viewer: per-flight analysis settings
# travel with the flight, not with the repository.
*_conf.yaml

# One-off local repair helper for the 2026-08-01 clock jump cleanup.
fix_clock_shift.py

# Claude Code's per-machine settings: a Bash permission allowlist that suits
# one person's workflow, not a property of the project. Committing it would
# grant those permissions to everyone who clones.
.claude/
